      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"revvbard\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/f07891/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> revvbard:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>(we had to flip 3 station cards. My understanding is that since the ship came out during the aftermath event phase it is considered unengaged so we merit a station card flip (this i may have got wrong)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You did this right.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"revvbard\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/f07891/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> revvbard:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As the next round began a travel event in the sector with the flagship instructed me to move the ship with the most [E] to the sector with the fewest ships, so with 2 opp. ships in one sector and my two strike force ships in the either … we chose to move the flagship into our sector.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p> Assuming an Opp ship appeared in the left Sector, you did this right. </p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"revvbard\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/f07891/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> revvbard:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Through some great cards I was able to install tech and use boosts to get Vigilance attack to sixteen … more than enough to wipe out the Hive Master …&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Vigilance can build up quickly, so this isn't that uncommon.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"revvbard\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/f07891/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> revvbard:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>we easily won on round 2 … did I miss something?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Doesn't seem like it from what you wrote.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Welcome to the forums!!!</p>",
