    {
      "id": 108172,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-07-03T14:30:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"revvbard\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/f07891/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> revvbard:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ok I'm missing an important rule here … 16 weapon only does 8 damage? why is this halved? I've totally missed this … please explain!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Damage Dealt = Your Weaponry - Their Shields</p>\n<p>16W (vigi) - 8D (Hive) = 8 Energy Damage dealt. (Hive would deal you damage in the same way simultaneously)</p>\n<p>You always remove energy from shields first. Since Hive started at 6W/8D, it would end with 6W/0D</p>\n<p>Does that help?</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:38:35.964Z",
