      "raw": "[quote=\"revvbard\"]\n\nOk I&#39;m missing an important rule here ... 16 weapon only does 8 damage? why is this halved? I&#39;ve totally missed this ... please explain!\n\n[/quote]\n\nDamage Dealt = Your Weaponry - Their Shields\n\n16W (vigi) - 8D (Hive) = 8 Energy Damage dealt. (Hive would deal you damage in the same way simultaneously)\n\nYou always remove energy from shields first. Since Hive started at 6W/8D, it would end with 6W/0D\n\nDoes that help?\n",
